"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Watch a game in the park</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Watch a real game on TV (with the sound off)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Play yourselves! </span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: 24px;font-family: Chaloops-Medium;\">How to play:</span>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0,0,0);background-color: rgb(255,255,255);font-size: medium;font-family: Verdana;\">Imagine you are football commentators. Work together as a team to describe what is happening. See how many of the 'ed' verbs below you can use!</span></p>\n", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]